      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Does the world matter? Like some worlds cause trouble and others don't? \n\nI'm just thinking that if the bug isn't obvious in VRChat home using any avatar there (avatar might be irrelevant) then it would help to have some example for reproduction.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
