  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2023-06-08T15:58:45.195Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Being the menu the most important piece of the UI of the game, all of its components (such as images, texts, buttons and so on...) should be rendered on top of everything else, and so being immune to object getting between the user and the menu.\n\nThis is not the current behaviour, or at least, it's not consistant throught the menu. Some images, such as the ones for world thumbnails, are always rendered on top, but others, such as avatar thumbnail images, are not so \"lucky\". I request for this bug to be fixed.",
